<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Dakshinanchal Vidyut Vitran Nigam Ltd. v. M/s Creative Entrepreneurs LLP, FAO(OS) (COMM) 307/2026</td></tr>
